<title>USA: Pride Petroleum sells $325 mln 10-yr notes.</title>
<headline>Pride Petroleum sells $325 mln 10-yr notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Pride Petroleum was priced Friday, according to lead manager Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp.</p>
<p>BORROWER - PRIDE PETROLEUM SERVICES INC</p>
<p>AMT $325 MLN	 COUPON 9.375 PCT  MATURITY 5/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 11/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA3   YIELD  9.375 PCT  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-MINUS  SPREAD 262.5 BP   CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTE: EQUITY CALL FOR 1/3 OF DEAL AT PAR PLUS COUPON</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
